# No early stop after PR (act or park)

Before ending any shipping turn with an open PR:

```sh
npm run pr:arm-and-park -- --pr <n>
```

- Exit **0** — gates clear; auto-merge armed; turn may end.
- Exit **2** — **parked** (waiting on bots/CI only); auto-merge armed; **OK to end turn**. Do not `--watch`.
- Exit **3** — actionable work remains; fix CI/threads/conflicts before ending.
- Exit **1** — tooling error; fix and retry.

Never end with "done" / "shipped" / "CI green so we're good" while exit **3** actionable work remains.

Never burn a turn sleep-polling for exit 0 while only bots/CI are pending — that is exit **2**; park.

Full ship bar: **`WORKFLOW.md`**.
